      "title": "LIL Lab",
      "headings": [
        "LIL Lab",
        "Welcome to the Language and Infant Learning Lab!",
        "Lab News"
      ],
      "text": "LIL Lab Welcome to the Language and Infant Learning Lab! In the LIL (Language and Infant Learning) Lab , we study how language and cognition develops. We are part of the Department of Cognitive Science at the University of California, San Diego . In our research, we study how infants, children, and adults develop and become skilled language users. We ask questions about how children learn new words and concepts, as well as investigate the driving factors that motivate learning. Learn more on our research page or read up on our recent publications . If you're interested in participating in our current studies, check out this page ! Click here if you're interested in joining the lab! Learn more about our research Lab News",
